      "id": "moe-story",
      "type": "text",
      "width": "full",
      "heading": "LEARNING BY SHIPPING",
      "body": "Moving On Express was my first game and my first time using Unity, Bolt and MagicaVoxel. I built almost everything—from the game design and voxel assets to the mechanical and technical implementation—in one week. The soundtrack was created by CillianCreates.\n\nYou play a mover loading a family’s belongings into a truck under a time limit. Speed matters, but damaged property comes out of your paycheck. It is a small idea, but shipping it taught me more than another month of abstract preparation would have.",
